@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
top to bottom direction
component "Browser\nMVC pages + SignalR JS" as UI
package "ASP.NET Core MVC .NET 8" {
 component "Web\nReportsController\nPricingController\nSales / Returns" as W
 component "Application\nReportService / PricingService\nSale / Return services" as A
 component "Infrastructure\nEF repositories / report query" as I
 queue "PriceChangeQueue\nbounded in-memory Channel" as Q
 component "PriceDispatchWorker" as Worker
 component "PriceHub\nSignalR" as H
}
database "SQL Server\nexisting review schema" as DB
UI --> W : HTTP request
W --> A : await business operation
A --> I : interface contract
I --> DB : await query / commit
A --> Q : enqueue after price commit
Q --> Worker : async consumption
Worker --> H : BookPriceChanged
H --> UI : realtime notification
note bottom of Q
Demo only: not durable; no replay / delivery guarantee.
Stock posting remains inside the sale/return DB transaction.
end note
@enduml
